{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JVmb46S7J21794555100.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>廉署執行處處長(政府部門)蔡樹強獲委任為副廉政專員，接替將退休的丘樹春。</p><p></p><p>54歲的蔡樹強同時會接任執行處首長，本月17日起生效。</p><p></p><p>廉政專員胡英明表示，蔡樹強投身廉署28年，深信他定能帶領執行處維持高度專業反貪水平。胡英明亦衷心感謝丘樹春過去10年出任副廉政專員及執行處首長期間，在廉政建設方面作出貢獻。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:58:02.048778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:17:40.659264+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:51:25.670338+00:00","content_hash":"52db6d55eb00b09d9c39fc22aa34ec535d0e92ce0589ab44b114ae98eab92503","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:58:02.048778+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}